.SH FORMAT REPLACEMENTS
.PP
\fB{percentage_used}\fR: Percentage of disk in use.\&
.PP
\fB{percentage_free}\fR: Percentage of free disk space
.PP
\fB{total}\fR: Total amount of space on the disk, partition, or mountpoint.\& Automatically selects unit based on size remaining.\&
.PP
\fB{used}\fR: Amount of used disk space.\& Automatically selects unit based on size remaining.\&
.PP
\fB{free}\fR: Amount of available disk space for normal users.\& Automatically selects unit based on size remaining.\&
.PP
\fB{path}\fR: The path for each disk specified in the configuration.\&
.PP
\fB{specific_total}\fR: Total amount of space on the disk, partition, or mountpoint in a specific unit.\& Defaults to bytes.\&
.PP
\fB{specific_used}\fR: Amount of used disk space in a specific unit.\& Defaults to bytes.\&
.PP
\fB{specific_free}\fR: Amount of available disk space for normal users in a specific unit.\& Defaults to bytes.\&
.PP
.SH NUMBER FORMAT MODIFIERS
.PP
\fB{total}\fR, \fB{used}\fR and \fB{free}\fR auto\-scale with a binary prefix (KiB, GiB, …).\&
Their rendering can be tuned with fmt\-style modifiers, e.\&g.\& \fB"{free:>}"\fR or
\fB"{free:G}"\fR, combined in any order:
.PP
\fB<\fR, \fB=\fR, \fB>\fR: Alignment/padding (left, column\-align, right).\&
.PP
\fBu\fR / \fBU\fR: Hide (\fBu\fR) or show (\fBU\fR) the unit suffix.\& Shown by default with an auto
scale, hidden by default when a scale is forced.\&
.PP
\fB#\fR, \fBk\fR, \fBM\fR, \fBG\fR, \fBT\fR, \fBP\fR: Force a fixed scale instead of auto\-selecting
(\fB#\fR = base scale).\& Forcing a scale hides the scale prefix and, by default, the
unit.\& E.\&g.\& \fB"{free:G}"\fR always shows gibibytes.\&
.PP
\fBi\fR: Force integer display (no decimals).\&
.PP
\fBb\fR / \fBB\fR: Force decimal base 1000 (\fBb\fR) or binary base 1024 (\fBB\fR); disk values
are binary by default.\&
.PP
A trailing number is a fixed width for the coefficient when a scale is forced;
overflow is shown as \fB#\fR characters (e.\&g.\& \fB"{free:=3#}"\fR → \fB###\fR).\&
.PP
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
"disk": {
	"interval": 30,
	"format": "{percentage_free}% free on {path}",
}
.fi
.RE
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
"disk": {
	"interval": 30,
	"format": "{percentage_free}% free on {path}",
	"header": "Disks: ",
	"paths": ["/", "/home"],
	"separator": " ",
}
.fi
.RE
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
"disk": {
	"interval": 30,
	"paths": ["/"],
	"format": "{specific_free:0\&.2f} GB out of {specific_total:0\&.2f} GB available\&. Alternatively {free} out of {total} available",
	"unit": "GB"
}

	// 1434\&.25 GB out of 2000\&.00 GB available\&. Alternatively 1\&.4TiB out of 1\&.9TiB available\&.
.fi
.RE
